{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-2-5","kind":"proposition","title":"平方差恒等式的几何证明","englishTitle":"If a straight line be cut into equal and unequal segments, the rectangle contained by the unequal segments of the whole together with the square on the straight line between the points of section is equal to the square on the half.","book":2,"number":5,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.5","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.5/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":5,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷二"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-2-5@raw-8d629b2a2fc25be1","contentId":"euclid-2-5","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8d629b2a2fc25be1a648ec1b1bce70c2a864b90741dc68ed8e3dd5e90e159006","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-2-5.statement","euclid-2-5.construction.1","euclid-2-5.construction.2","euclid-2-5.proof.1","euclid-2-5.proof.2","euclid-2-5.proof.3","euclid-2-5.construction.3","euclid-2-5.proof.4","euclid-2-5.conclusion","euclid-2-5.historical.1","euclid-2-5.historical.2","euclid-2-5.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-2-5.statement","contentId":"euclid-2-5","revisionId":"euclid-2-5@raw-8d629b2a2fc25be1","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dc24de3e90b89ab4f570890deffc9adb3db5b2ec06883a4c2953f98d347cc577","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a straight line be cut into equal and unequal segments, the rectangle contained by the unequal segments of the whole together with the square on the straight line between the points of section is equal to the square on the half."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"设线段 AB 在 C 点被平分，又在 D 点被分成不等的两段。那么以 AD、DB 为边的矩形面积，加上以 CD 为边的正方形面积，等于以半段 CB 为边的正方形面积。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线两平分之又任两分之其任两分线矩内直角形及分内线上直角方形并与平分半线上直角方形等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"设线段先在中点平分，再另取一点分成不等的两段；以这两段为边的矩形面积，加上两个分点之间线段的平方，等于半条原线段的平方。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-5.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-2-5","revisionId":"euclid-2-5@raw-8d629b2a2fc25be1","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"43f89acbdc0add66f84705295c4a8d7691b479569b739b0b6b78a63345296233","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a straight line AB be cut into equal segments at C and into unequal segments at D; I say that the rectangle contained by AD, DB together with the square on CD is equal to the square on CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"设直线 AB 在点 C 处被平分，在点 D 处被不等分；我断言：由 AD、DB 所作矩形与 CD 上的正方形之和，等于 CB 上的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-5.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-2-5","revisionId":"euclid-2-5@raw-8d629b2a2fc25be1","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5a16d9035810867e226e1b637a7b27d074c338721ad8a290be06a5c29e126639","citations":["euclid-1-46","euclid-1-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the square CEFB be described on CB, [[I. 46](/principles/euclid-1-46)] and let BE be joined; through D let DG be drawn parallel to either CE or BF, through H again let KM be drawn parallel to either AB or EF, and again through A let AK be drawn parallel to either CL or BM. [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"请在CB上描述一下正方形 CEFB并让BE连接;D DG比CE或BF比H比AB或EF比KM并再次通过 A let AK 与 CL 或 BM 平行。 [[I. 46](/principles/euclid-1-46)] [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-5.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-2-5","revisionId":"euclid-2-5@raw-8d629b2a2fc25be1","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"79278a422bb3086a1b6045e2ed386ffb9321511f125a699a78005336aba89508","citations":["euclid-1-43"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the complement CH is equal to the complement HF, [[I. 43](/principles/euclid-1-43)] let DM be added to each; therefore the whole CM is equal to the whole DF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"之后,由于CH补充等于HF补充,因此,每个补充DM补充;因此,整个CM补充等于整个DF。 [[I. 43](/principles/euclid-1-43)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-5.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-2-5","revisionId":"euclid-2-5@raw-8d629b2a2fc25be1","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a61b2e6e408c495e09c27829753b33ebeda1664ac25bbe9530b1679a4e398798","citations":["euclid-1-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CM is equal to AL, since AC is also equal to CB; [[I. 36](/principles/euclid-1-36)] therefore AL is also equal to DF. Let CH be added to each; therefore the whole AH is equal to the gnomon NOP."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CM等于AL,因为AC也等于CB,因此AL也等于DF。（相关点与线段：CH、AH、NOP）；这里讨论曲尺形。 [[I. 36](/principles/euclid-1-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-5.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-2-5","revisionId":"euclid-2-5@raw-8d629b2a2fc25be1","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"29fd830e7091decdd344c0b75ed51e896642202514cede91f76e0d321ebea86f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AH is the rectangle AD, DB, for DH is equal to DB, therefore the gnomon NOP is also equal to the rectangle AD, DB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AH是矩形 AD,DB,DH等于DB,因此曲尺形 NOP也等于矩形 AD,DB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-5.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-2-5","revisionId":"euclid-2-5@raw-8d629b2a2fc25be1","order":6,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6220aa8017cc1273f33025034387a7d95b1dfc51b22e6d5552ac290410559b43","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let LG, which is equal to the square on CD, be added to each; therefore the gnomon NOP and LG are equal to the rectangle contained by AD, DB and the square on CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"每人加LG,相当于CD的正方形;因此,曲尺形,NOP和LG等于AD,DB和CD的矩形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-5.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-2-5","revisionId":"euclid-2-5@raw-8d629b2a2fc25be1","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"78ce70abcbd69c00d1bd93134df0a7f4623bb4d4314f0e1b441cbfa36fd3d6ce","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the gnomon NOP and LG are the whole square CEFB, which is described on CB; therefore the rectangle contained by AD, DB together with the square on CD is equal to the square on CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,曲尺形 NOP和LG是整个正方形 CEFB, CB页上有说明;因此,矩形页上AD、DB页加上正方形页CD页,等于CB页上的正方形页。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-5.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-2-5","revisionId":"euclid-2-5@raw-8d629b2a2fc25be1","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-5.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-2-5","revisionId":"euclid-2-5@raw-8d629b2a2fc25be1","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c155a65a09bcaa9bc11cbf2ac6cb2acc79bfa5dfe5ab71224f31e1a20197ec69","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线两平分之又任两分之其任两分线矩内直角形及分内线上直角方形并与平分半线上直角方形等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"设线段先在中点平分，再另取一点分成不等的两段；以这两段为边的矩形面积，加上两个分点之间线段的平方，等于半条原线段的平方。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-5.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-2-5","revisionId":"euclid-2-5@raw-8d629b2a2fc25be1","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"229a1c930febeea55bfa8e6e22c57abe9a3105288992e92587094d6b5a2f29a3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰试于丙乙线上作丙己直角方形次作乙戊对角线从丁作丁庚线与乙己平行遇对角线于辛次从辛作壬癸线与丙乙平行次从甲作甲子线与丙戊平行末从壬癸线引长之遇于子夫丁壬癸庚皆直角方形〈本篇四之系〉而辛丁与丁乙两线等〈一卷卅四〉癸辛与丙丁两线等则甲辛直角形在任分之甲丁丁乙矩线内而癸庚为分内线丙丁上直角方形也今欲显甲辛直角形及癸庚直角方形并与丙己直角方形等者于丙辛辛己相等之两馀方形〈一篇四三〉每加一丁壬直角方形即丙壬及丁己两直角形等矣而甲癸与丙壬两形同在平行线内又底等即形亦等〈一卷〉〈卅六〉则甲癸与丁巳亦等也即又每加一丙辛直角形则丑寅卯罄折形岂不与甲辛等次于罄折形又加一癸庚直角方形岂不与丙巳直角方形等也而甲辛癸庚两形并亦与丙己等也则甲丁丁乙矩线内直角形及丙丁上直角方形并与丙乙上直角方形等注曰以数明之设十数两平分之各五又任分之为八为二则三为分内数〈三者五所以大于二之较又八所以大于五之〉〈较〉二八之实十六三之羃九与五之羃二十五等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：尝试在 丙乙 线上画一个 丙己 正方形，然后从 丁 画一条对角线与 丁庚 平行，并在 辛 与一条对角线相交，从 甲 画 壬癸 平行于 丙乙 的线，甲子 平行于 丙戊 的线，最后从 壬癸 延伸到 子。两条线都是平方 〈本篇四之系〉，同时 辛丁 和 丁乙 线等于 〈一卷卅四〉癸辛，丙丁 线也相等。然后矩形 甲辛 位于矩阵 甲丁丁乙 内，而 癸庚 是内线 丙丁 上的平方。显示矩形 甲辛 和 癸庚 的平方，以及等于 丙己 的平方，在 丙辛辛己，矩形 甲辛 和 癸庚 的平方等于 丙辛辛己 处的平方。显示矩形 甲辛 和 癸庚，以及等于 丙己 的平方，丙辛辛己 是 丙辛辛己 的平方。现在，要显示矩形 甲辛 和 癸庚 的平方，以及 丙己 的平方在 丙辛辛己 处相等。现在，要显示矩形 甲辛 和 癸庚 的平方，以及 丙己 的平方在 丙辛辛己 处相等。显示 甲辛 和 癸庚 的平方，以及 丙己 的平方在 丙辛辛己 处相等。显示 甲辛 和 癸庚 的平方，平方等于 丙己。显示 甲辛 和 癸庚 的平方，平方等于 丙己。两个相等的余数平方 〈一篇四三〉 等于每个 丁壬 方形，即 丙壬 和 丁己。甲癸 和 丙壬 都在平行线上，它们的底部相等，因此形状也相等 〈一卷〉〈卅六〉 然后 甲癸 和 丁巳 相等。即对于每个额外的 丙辛 矩形，则 丑寅卯 弯曲形状等于 甲辛。再加一个 癸庚 方形等于 丙巳，甲辛癸庚 也等于 丙己。然后 甲丁丁乙 内的矩形以及 丙丁 和 丙乙 上的方形等于 丙乙 上的平方。注意：使用数字说明，令十均分，然后除以八得到二，然后三是内部数字 〈三者五所以大于二之较又八所以大于五之〉〈较〉，然后三是内部数字，八的实际值是十六，三的平方是九，五的平方是二十五级。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-5.source","contentId":"euclid-2-5","revisionId":"euclid-2-5@raw-8d629b2a2fc25be1","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4e42012c2fa53e0a00a4e2a51cdd3d373b2cb51514c90cb538682b321eb2861b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.5/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.5\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷二"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-2-5:euclid-1-46:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-2-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-2-5.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-46","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.5/","sourceLabel":"I. 46"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-2-5:euclid-1-31:expli